# Android and Windows builds

## Windows executable

Run the **Build Windows EXE** workflow from the Actions tab. It creates a `Terminxractor.exe` artifact using PyInstaller. The workflow also runs automatically when a `v*` tag is pushed.

## Android APK

Run the **Build Android APK** workflow from the Actions tab. It creates a debug APK artifact using Buildozer. The APK currently provides the extraction/download UI; YouTube upload credentials should not be embedded in the APK.

To build a release, add signing secrets and a release-specific workflow before publishing. Only extract or upload media that you own or are authorized to redistribute.
